  "prefLabel": "He-P 4021.16 Report to Individuals of Exceeding Dose Limits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4021.16 Report to Individuals of Exceeding Dose Limits. When a licensee or registrant is required pursuant to He-P 4021.14 or He-P 4021.15 to report to DHHS/RHS any exposure of an identified occupationally exposed individual, or an identified member of the public, to radiation or radioactive material, the licensee or registrant shall also provide a copy of the report submitted to DHHS/RHS to the individual, and such report shall be transmitted at a time no later than the transmittal to DHHS/RHS.\n\nSource. #5903, eff 2-1-95; ss by #6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #8481, eff 11-5-05; ss by #10604, eff 5-23-14; ss by #14091, eff 10-1-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p4001-4022.html"
